8	/**
9	 * Rejects creating an owner when the owner's city already contains 50 or more owners. The city is
10	 * compared case-insensitively with runs of whitespace collapsed to a single space, matching how
11	 * {@link EnsureUniqueHousehold} normalizes text. The owner being created is not yet persisted, so
12	 * it is not part of the count.
